{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-categorical-dirac-operator-exists","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:categorical-dirac-operator-exists","kind":"proposition","title":"Existence of the categorical Dirac operator","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-dirac-operator"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-categorical-dirac-operator-exists"],"tags":["existence","dirac-operator"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.CategoricalDirac.exists","text":"categorical-dirac-operator-exists.md","leanSource":"categorical-dirac-operator-exists.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:categorical-dirac-operator-exists\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)</code> be a quantum observable universe with connection <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nabla</code>, substrate parameter <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>, and Reeb derivation <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\xi</code>. The categorical Dirac operator <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{D}_\\nabla = q^{-1} \\nabla + (1 - q^{-1}) \\iota_\\xi \\nabla \\colon A \\to \\Omega^1(A)</code> exists as a morphism in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{C}</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-dirac-operator-exists.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"4.12.3","page":"b/prop-categorical-dirac-operator-exists","qa":{"counts":{"pass":90,"fail":0,"warn":1,"na":13,"unknown":0,"stale":70},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.CategoricalDirac.exists","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-dirac-operator-exists.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
